    <blockquote class="pull-quote">"I'm less interested in what a model can do in the abstract, and more in what it can do for one real user, on one real problem."</blockquote>
    <p>My current work centers on the <strong>Claude API</strong> and the broader generative AI toolchain — experimenting with prompt design, retrieval-augmented systems, and the fundamentals of machine learning that sit underneath them. I document what I build and continue to expand this portfolio as new work is finished.</p>
